      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: I think a comment here that we align to a multiple of 4stride for baseVertex, and round the storage up to a multiple of 4stride (effectively the same as aligning count to a multiple of 4) w/ zero\u0027ing the extra space at the end is for ARM speculative execution and other driver issues.",
